  "description": "The pure fool + pervert Lim Tae-O dreams of a loving relationship. Because he's gay, he is estranged from his parents and at odds with his friends. Even the men he's dated can't overcome Tae-O's obsession, so he's been dumped many times. Thinking it's his last chance, he wants to finds a roommate to be his FWB... But then he meets Choi Hyeon, a roommate who suits Tae-O's taste more than he could have imagined! Like fate, he falls in love at first sight.\n\nThe strange co-habitation of Tae-O, who needs love, and Choi Hyeon, who needs attention. ♥\nCan this love be successful?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
